{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026T226SUZgZ31794612987.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>政府推出沙田住宅地招標。</p><p></p><p>地皮位於大涌橋路與安心街交界，現時為油站及停車場，佔地逾8.6萬平方呎，可建樓面逾53.4萬平方呎，預計提供960伙，下周五起招標，12月18日截標，市場初步估值約25億至29億元，每平方呎樓面地價，相當於6,000至6,800元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.257675+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T13:18:53.276309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:23.184338+00:00","content_hash":"c31dcfc5522be7abe1041f2f52b635670357b673c86324c311398173c0d44905","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.257675+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}